        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13060.txt",
        "text_sha256": "a0f56b82a58844bd51fe75c26292a0eff66d463f9d099ff5ac7c2f6745b8430d",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1997-08-25/pdf/97-22703.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. Establishment of Emergency Board (‘‘Board’’). There is established,\neffective August 21, 1997, a Board of three members to be appointed by\nthe President to investigate these disputes. No member shall be pecuniarily\nor otherwise interested in any organization of railroad employees or any\nrailroad carrier. The Board shall perform its functions subject to the availabil-\nity of funds."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1981,
      "char_start": 1863,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13060#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13060#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "62 FR 45139, PDF pages 1-1",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "4459b8aab3260093d54c3e6d90bd412e77e13321caa17c07dd93fd980ff0f4e9",
        "signing_date": "1997-08-21",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13060.txt",
        "text_sha256": "a0f56b82a58844bd51fe75c26292a0eff66d463f9d099ff5ac7c2f6745b8430d",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1997-08-25/pdf/97-22703.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. Report. The Board shall report to the President with respect to\nthese disputes within 30 days of its creation."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2314,
      "char_start": 1982,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13060#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13060#sec3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "62 FR 45139, PDF pages 1-1",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "4459b8aab3260093d54c3e6d90bd412e77e13321caa17c07dd93fd980ff0f4e9",
        "signing_date": "1997-08-21",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13060.txt",
        "text_sha256": "a0f56b82a58844bd51fe75c26292a0eff66d463f9d099ff5ac7c2f6745b8430d",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1997-08-25/pdf/97-22703.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. Maintaining Conditions. As provided by section 10 of the Act, from\nthe date of the creation of the Board and for 30 days after the Board\nhas submitted its report to the President, no change in the conditions out\nof which the disputes arose shall be made by the parties to the controversy,\nexcept by agreement of the parties."
    },
